  (text "What this does: Passes messages and a few control/status signals between the processors without feeding power through an off MCU.\nConnects to: U201 flight <-> U401 comms. Includes the flight-requested comms reset, battery-valid and USB-present status, not just UART data."
    (at 15.24 27.94 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "b9f9953c-e805-5599-ac98-611b3cb851d3")))
